    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00024',',AA.Oen00024,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrPo,Hi18 HiNoNoUS,NoNoUSNY,ArPo GeFa,emma lazarus;statue of liberty;tired your poor;huddled masses,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the lines to the poem by Emma Lazarus that is on the base of the Statue of Liberty  in order.,^AA.DCL.A.120013,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=18 FntColor=black BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Give me your tired your poor,Your huddled masses ,yearning to breathe free,The wretched refuse ,of your teeming shore.,Send these the homeless ,tempest-tossed to me-,I lift my lamp beside ,the golden door.');
