    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00029',',AA.Oen00029,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrPo,CuPo,,ArPo,limerick;young man;kew,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the lines to the following limerick in the proper order.,^AA.DCL.A.147143,Rows=5 Cols=1 FntSize=12 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,There once was a young man from Kew,Who found a dead mouse in his stew.,Said the waiter Don~t shout,Or wave it about,Or the rest will be wanting one too!');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00030',',AA.Oen00030,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrPo,CuPo,,ArPo,twelve months,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the lines to the poem in their order.,^AA.DCL.A.142013,Rows=5 Cols=1 FntSize=20 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,There are twelve months,in all the year as ,I hear many men say,But the merriest month,in all the year,Is the merry month of May.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00031',',AA.Oen00031,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrPo,LiCl,,ArPo,be my love;marlowe,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the words to the poem Come live With Me and Be My Love by Marlowe in order.,^AA.DCL.A.149123,Rows=8 Cols=1 FntSize=24 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=yellow LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Come live with me ,and be my love,And we will all ,the pleasures prove,That hills and valleys ,dales and fields,Woods or steepy ,mountain yields.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00032',',AA.Oen00032,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrReBiNT,ReCh ReJu,,ArPo ReBi,23rd psalm;lord;shepherd,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Bible/Psalms,Place the first 7 lines to the 23rd Psalm in the proper order,^AA.DCL.A.025103,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=12 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,The Lord is my shepherd I shall not want,He maketh me to lie down in green pastures,He leadeth me beside the still waters.,He restoreth my soul,He leadeth me in the paths of ,righteousness for his name~s sake.,Yea though I walk through the valley, of the shadow of death,I will fear no evil-');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00033',',AA.Oen00033,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrReBiNT,ReCh ReJu,,ArPo ReBi,23rd psalm;lord;shepherd,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Bible/Psalms,Place the last 7 lines to the 23rd Psalm in the proper order,^AA.DCL.A.025103,Rows=10 Cols=1 FntSize=14 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=pink LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,For thou art with me-,Thy rod and thy staff they comfort me.,Thou preparest a table for me ,in the presence of mine enemies,Thou anointest my head with oil, my cup runneth over.,Surely goodness and mercy shall ,follow me all the days of my life:,And I will dwell ,in the house of the Lord for ever.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00034',',AA.Oen00034,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrSo,LiCl,EuBrGB,ArPo,auld lang syne;old acquaintance;scottish,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the words to the traditional Scottish song  -Auld Lang Syne- in order.,^AA.DCL.A.157083,Rows=7 Cols=1 FntSize=20 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Should old ,acquaintance be forgot,And never brought,to min~?,Should old ,acquaintance be forgot,And auld lang syne!');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00035',',AA.Oen00035,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrSoRe,ReCh,,ArPo Re,onward;christian;soldiers,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Music/Christmas,Place the words to this popular Christian hymn in order.,^AA.DCL.A.177113,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=30 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Onward ,Christian ,soldiers,Marching ,as to war,With the Cross ,of Jesus,Going on ,before.');
