    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00075',',AA.Oen00075,EdUGames tm,20030105,4,ThWrNu,Li,,ArPo,three blind mice mice;run;farmer~s wife;tails;carving knife,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/Nursery Rhymes,Place the lines to the nursery rhyme in their order.,^AA.DCL.A.135063,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=22 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Three blind mice ,see how they run!,They all ran after ,the farmer~s wife,She cut off their tails ,with a carving knife.,Did you ever see ,such a sight in your life,As three blind mice?');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00076',',AA.Oen00076,EdUGames tm,20030105,5,ThWrNu,Li,,ArPo,little;girl;curl;forehead;horrid,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/Nursery Rhymes,Place the lines to the nursery rhyme in their order.,^AA.DCL.A.134113,Rows=8 Cols=1 FntSize=18 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,There was a little girl,Who had a little curl,Right in the middle ,of her forehead,And when she was good,She was very very good,But when she was bad ,she was horrid.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00077',',AA.Oen00077,EdUGames tm,20030105,5,ThWrNu,Li,,ArPo,little;piggy;roast beef;none,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/Nursery Rhymes,Place the lines to the nursery rhyme in their order.,^AA.DCL.A.135033,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=14 FntColor=blue BkGndColor=white LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,This little piggy went ,to market.,This little piggy stayed ,home.,This little piggy had roast ,beef.,This little piggy had none.,This little piggy cried Wee! Wee! Wee!,all the way home.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00078',',AA.Oen00078,EdUGames tm,20030105,6,ThWrNu,Li,,ArPo,spreading;chestnut tree;village smithy;sinewy hands,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/Nursery Rhymes,Place the lines to the nursery rhyme in their order.,^AA.DCL.A.');
    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00079',',AA.Oen00079,EdUGames tm,20030105,9,ThWrNu,Li,,ArPo,edgar allan poe;midnight dreary;pondered;weak and weary;quaint;curious,,aPRA1_10 zPRA1_15,,,,,Poems/American Classic,Place the lines to The Raven by Edgar Allan Poe in their proper order.,^AA.DCL.A.130093,Rows=9 Cols=1 FntSize=16 FntColor=black BkGndColor=lightGray LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=Yes ,Once upon a midnight dreary ,while I pondered weak and weary,Over many a quaint ,and curious volume of ,forgotten lore,While I nodded nearly napping ,suddenly there came a tapping,As of someone gently rapping ,rapping at my chamber door.');
