    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00219',',AA.Oen00219,Ed-U-Games tm,20070329,5,ThWrPo EvWaAm LoHiBa Lo,Hi16 HiNoNoUS,NoNoUSMABo NoNoUSMA,HiMaBa HiMaWa PeFa ArPo,american revolution;yankee doodle,,aPRA1_70 zPRA1_30,,,,,History/American/Revolution,Place the lines to Yankee Doodle in order.,,Rows=8 Cols=1 FntSize=14 FntColor=black BkGndColor=green LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=No ,And there they~d fife ,away like fun`,And play on ,cornstalk fiddles`,And some had ribbons ,red as blood`,All bound around ,their middles.');
