    this.roundMap.set('AA.Oen00223',',AA.Oen00223,Ed-U-Games tm,20070329,5,ThWrPo EvWaAm LoHiBa Lo,Hi16 HiNoNoUS,NoNoUSMABo NoNoUSMA,HiMaBa HiMaWa PeFa ArPo,american revolution;yankee doodle,,aPRA1_70 zPRA1_30,,,,,History/American/Revolution,Place the lines to Yankee Doodle in order.,,Rows=4 Cols=1 FntSize=14 FntColor=black BkGndColor=green LnCnt=1 SingleScreen=No Sort=No ,But I can~t tell half I see,They kept up such a smother;,So I took my hat off` made a bow`,And scampered home to mother.');
